<article class="rule-card" id="card-chapter-3">
<h3 class="chapter-heading" id="chapter-3">1.6 第一步：基本规则方向准入判定 (Direction Qualifying Rules)</h3>
<div style="background:#f0f9ff; border:1.5px solid #0284c7; border-radius:8px; padding:10px 14px; margin:12px 0 16px; font-size:0.86rem; color:#0f172a;">
