<td style="padding: 6px 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;">近 30 分钟累计净卖盘 <code>net_delta_30m &lt;= -4500 手</code></td>
<td style="padding: 6px 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: #64748b;">中周期主动卖盘巨额倾泻，击穿支撑中枢打破平衡</td>
</tr>
<tr style="background: #f8fafc;">
<td style="padding: 6px 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-align: center; font-weight: 700; color: #b91c1c; background: #fef2f2;">要素 2</td>
<td style="padding: 6px 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;"><strong>10m 双柱加速砸盘</strong><br/><span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #64748b;">(Dual-Bar Acceleration)</span></td>
